flowchart TB
  subgraph C1["1. Tagging each request (dmclock, tag_calc)"]
    direction LR
    A["request from class<br/>client / recovery / best-effort"] --> B["R = max(now, R_prev + (δ+cost)/reservation)<br/>P = max(now, P_prev + (δ+cost)/weight)<br/>L = max(now, L_prev + (δ+cost)/limit)"]
